{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KTKTbeBHU11793316277.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英特爾第三季度業績好過市場預期，但第四季度業績指引不如預期，股價在延長交易時段曾跌近兩成二。</p><p></p><p>公司季內純利33.2億美元，按年倒退一成八。經調整每股攤薄盈利52美仙，較預期多12美仙。淨收入165.1億美元，與預期相若。</p><p></p><p>預期第四季度經調整每股攤薄盈利為25美仙，低過預期的43美仙。收入料最高達160億美元，亦低過預期的171億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T00:20:55.763193+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T22:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:18:11.635078+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:18:13.739619+00:00","content_hash":"6772109efef84d4f59c8a369c33fcf9413f6f1aa8a5ce36a31eb3b8ded17639e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T00:20:55.763193+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}